  "name": "Christmas Punch",
  "subtitle": "A sparkling fruit punch with gin, apple, ginger, and rosemary",
  "description": "A festive batch drink combining gin, prosecco, cloudy apple juice, herbal liqueur, fruit, and aromatic garnishes.",
